  </div></section><section id=\"section_2_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0\"><section class=\"mb-0\">\n    <div class=\"page-header py-5 py-md-0 ratio ratio-2x1 position-relative bg-white\">\n        <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/1990_7_2.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 991.9px)\">\n            <source srcset=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/1990_10_2.jpg\" media=\"(min-width: 992px)\">\n            <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/1990_10_2.jpg\" alt=\"Background\" class=\"w-100 h-100 position-absolute top-0 start-0 object-fit-cover\">\n        </picture>\n<div class=\"position-absolute w-100 w-lg-50 h-50 h-lg-100 bg-grad\"></div>        <div id=\"movie-overlay\" class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-end justify-content-lg-center align-items-center align-items-lg-start h-100 mx-lg-7\">\n        <div class=\"d-none d-lg-inline movie-awards mb-4 d-flex justify-content-start\"></div>    <img class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-lg-6\" src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/1990_8_3.png\" alt=\"Logo\">    <div class=\"movie-badges mb-2 d-flex justify-content-start\">        <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2\">2025</span>\n    <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2\">1hr 41mins</span>        <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageMisc/Dolby/Atmos/Vertical/DLB_Atms_vert_rgb_wht_@1x.png\" class=\"cert-20 me-2\" alt=\"Movie Sound Dolby Atmos\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_PG_RGB.svg\" class=\"cert-20\" alt=\"BBFC Cert PG\">\n    </div><p class=\"text-white opacity-6\"><small>Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Comedy</small></p>    </div>    </div>\n</div>\n</section></section><section id=\"section_3_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0\">            <div class=\"container my-5\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 order-1 order-lg-0\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">A Minecraft Movie</h3>\n\n\n                        <p><img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_PG_RGB.svg \" class=\"cert-40 my-4\" alt=\"BBFC Cert $certs\" ></p>\n\n                                                    <h3 class=\" fjalla-one-regular fs-4 text-dark mb-4\">Synopsis</h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-5 text-dark\">Four misfits find themselves struggling with ordinary problems when they are suddenly pulled through a mysterious portal into the Overworld: a bizarre, cubic wonderland that thrives on imagination. To get back home, they'll have to master this world while embarking on a magical quest with an unexpected, expert crafter, Steve.</p>\n                                                \n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                            <div class=\"col-7 col-md-8\">\n                                \n\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Duration:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">1hr 41mins</p>\n                                \n\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Available Sound Formats:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder sound-formats\">\n                                        Dolby Atmos                                    </p>\n                                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Genre:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Comedy</p>\n                                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Country:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">New Zealand, Sweden, United States</p>\n                                \n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-5 col-md-4\">\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Director:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Jared Hess</p>\n                                \n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Starring:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Jason Momoa,<br> Jack Black,<br> Jennifer Coolidge,<br> Danielle Brooks,<br> Matt Berry,<br> Emma Myers</p>\n                                                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                        <!-- <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                            </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“Florence Pugh and Andrew Garfield scorch…The pair’s chemistry is off the charts and each set-piece a showstopper in this tragic romance.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Kevin Maher, The Times\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“It’s such a joy to watch two such assured and natural performers allowed the room to exercise both movie star and actor muscles as well as showcase their ease with both comedy and drama.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Benjamin Lee, Guardian\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“The perfect movie for when you want to sit in your feelings and be taken on an unashamedly emotional journey…Garfield and Pugh are as dreamy a team as you’d hope!”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Tori Brazier, Metro\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“Andrew Garfield and Florence Pugh will break your heart in a London romance of rare honesty.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                                Helen O'Hara, Time Out\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure> -->\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <!-- Show Times -->\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 ps-lg-5 order-0 order-lg-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"d-none d-md-block position-sticky\" style=\"top: 164px\">\n                            <h2 class=\"fs