</div></section><section id=\"section_2_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0\"><section class=\"mb-0\">\n    <div class=\"page-header py-5 py-md-0 ratio ratio-2x1 position-relative bg-white\">\n        <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2047_7_1.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 991.9px)\">\n            <source srcset=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2047_10_1.jpg\" media=\"(min-width: 992px)\">\n            <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2047_10_1.jpg\" alt=\"Background\" class=\"w-100 h-100 position-absolute top-0 start-0 object-fit-cover\">\n        </picture>\n<div class=\"position-absolute w-100 w-lg-50 h-50 h-lg-100 bg-grad\"></div>        <div id=\"movie-overlay\" class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-end justify-content-lg-center align-items-center align-items-lg-start h-100 mx-lg-7\">\n        <div class=\"d-none d-lg-inline movie-awards mb-4 d-flex justify-content-start\"></div>    <img class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-lg-6\" src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2047_8_1.png\" alt=\"Logo\">    <div class=\"movie-badges mb-2 d-flex justify-content-start\">        <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2\">2005</span>\n    <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2\">2hr 6mins</span>        \n        <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_U_RGB.svg\" class=\"cert-20\" alt=\"BBFC Cert U\">\n    </div><p class=\"text-white opacity-6\"><small>Drama, Romance</small></p>    </div>    </div>\n</div>\n</section></section><section id=\"section_3_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0\">            <div class=\"container my-5\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 order-1 order-lg-0\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">Pride &amp; Prejudice - 20th Anniversary</h3>\n\n\n                        <p><img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_U_RGB.svg \" class=\"cert-40 my-4\" alt=\"BBFC Cert $certs\" ></p>\n\n                                                    <h3 class=\" fjalla-one-regular fs-4 text-dark mb-4\">Synopsis</h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-5 text-dark\">A story of love and life among the landed English gentry during the Georgian era. Mr. Bennet is a gentleman living in Hertfordshire with his overbearing wife and five daughters, but if he dies their house will be inherited by a distant cousin whom they have never met, so the family's future happiness and security is dependent on the daughters making good marriages.</p>\n                                                \n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                            <div class=\"col-7 col-md-8\">\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Release Date:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">April</p>\n                                \n\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Duration:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">2hr 6mins</p>\n                                \n\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Available Sound Formats:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder sound-formats\">\n                                        5.1                                    </p>\n                                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Genre:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Drama, Romance</p>\n                                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Country:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">France, United Kingdom</p>\n                                \n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-5 col-md-4\">\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Director:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Joe Wright</p>\n                                \n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Starring:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Judi Dench,<br> Matthew Macfadyen,<br> Tom Hollander,<br> Keira Knightley,<br> Meg Wynn Owen,<br> Carey Mulligan,<br> Kelly Reilly,<br> Rosamund Pike,<br> Donald Sutherland,<br> Brenda Blethyn</p>\n                                                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                        <!-- <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                            </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“Florence Pugh and Andrew Garfield scorch…The pair’s chemistry is off the charts and each set-piece a showstopper in this tragic romance.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Kevin Maher, The Times\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“It’s such a joy to watch two such assured and natural performers allowed the room to exercise both movie star and actor muscles as well as showcase their ease with both comedy and drama.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Benjamin Lee, Guardian\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“The perfect movie for when you want to sit in your feelings and be taken on an unashamedly emotional journey…Garfield and Pugh are as dreamy a team as you’d hope!”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Tori Brazier, Metro\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“Andrew Garfield and Florence Pugh will break your heart in a London romance of rare honesty.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                                Helen O'Hara, Time Out\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure> -->\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <!-- Show Times -->\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 ps-lg-5 order-0 order-lg-1\">\n                        \n           